    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      394.16,
      286.44,
      479.6
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: KDS/KUN/04/07/16/04/60(III). I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      481.03,
      286.46,
      615.16
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired : Lot No. 1 - 2 (Lots 2) allotments in total Extent of about 0.0080 Hectare of land in Preliminary Plan No. MAHA 6575 dated 19.05.2016 prepared by the Kandy District Surveyor-Superintendent on behalf of the Surveyor General situated in the Village of Menikhinna in the Gramaniladhari Division Menikhinna (705) of Minor Division of Udagampaha Korale of Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kundasale in Kandy District in the Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
